[69.538707, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.054632ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[69.539122, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.887993ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(1.46367ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.394351ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.167625ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(4.279181ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[69.53962, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(1.517931ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.500311ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
